node_modules/

# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores package.json/package-lock.json (JS
# tooling scaffold, inherited from upstream Odoo) - but this directory's
# package.json is the real, load-bearing dependency manifest docs-build:capture
# needs on a fresh clone (scripts/docs_build/capture_cli.py refuses to run
# without a `node_modules` an `npm install` here would produce). Un-ignore both.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
